		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">AX5103</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">AX5103 digital compact servo drive, 1 axis</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">AX 1-axis drive (the second digit of the reference is the number of axes). Rating from the project nomenclature: 3 A. Redrawn in vector from a picture of the project, terminals snapped to the 10 px grid. The motor and brake connectors are not on the pictures: the Motor terminals are generic, under the body. X06 function names are generic (0..7).</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
